OL,3,GNEWSAFestival announces historic
OL,4,Aall-female headliners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA country music event says it will make
OL,7,Fhistory as the first-ever major UK
OL,8,Fcamping festival to have all-female
OL,9,Fheadliners.
OL,11,FState Fayre at Hylands Park in
OL,12,FChelmsford will feature performances
OL,13,Ffrom Kacey Musgraves and The Chicks,
OL,14,Falongside the already-announced Shania
OL,15,FTwain across three days in June.
OL,17,FOrganisers Anna-Sophie Mertens and Alex
OL,18,FSimmonds described the acts as "three
OL,19,Fincredible artists".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
